
  VALERI DB Access
  Tab of: LGY PL RDS Access Workflow · Working document

  This tab outlines the access workflow for VALERI Oracle, PostgreSQL and Redshift databases.
  This tab is limited to the VALERI project only. For LGY, LGY Analytics and VHB, see their respective tabs.

  Prerequisites for VALERI DB access
  
    Jira related pre-approvals must be in place. All requirements are mandatory, and each must be submitted under its own ticket.
    ePAS CyberArk (PIV option) plus the ePAS groups/roles. All are mandatory, not either/or.
      
        CyberArk - CyberArk User - Production
        Group - VA\VA PAS Users
        Group(s)/Role(s) required for access to bastion servers
          One of these ePAS groups/roles must be assigned to your NMEA account: vaecwins_aws_valeri-rds-gateway-nprod, vaecwins_aws_valeri-rds-gateway-prod
        
      
    
  

