  ePAS Submission - Mandatory, Baseline Groups/Roles
  Note: This ePAS document submittal provides group/role approval with OIT. This is not to be confused with Jira related submittals. This is a separate, mandatory approval process.
  Step 1: Portal: https://epas.r02.med.va.gov/apps/myva/
  
    Go to the ePAS portal and select Submit Request. You'll be redirected to the Assignee tab.
    Assignee Information. Name, email, and domain are usually pre-populated. Fill manually if not.
      Domain: [DOMAIN/WINDOWSNAME]Employee type: Contractor
    Expiration of Elevated Privileges. "Date Expires" = your PIV expiration date.
    Strong Authentication Token. Only one NMEA is required.
      If you have a NMEA account, enter it including the domain name. Ensure it is PIV+0 at the end (very important)
      If not, enter a name in the blank field to create one, using: DOMAIN\[WINDOWSNAME]
    Supervisor/COR.
      Name: Corona, JoseEmail: Jose.Corona@va.gov
  

