  SNOW Ticket Submission
  Note: Only submit this AFTER your Jira and ePAS approvals are complete. It hands off to the Ops team for the provisioning phase.
  This is where your PIV account is actually added to the VALERI RDP Gateway server group(s) and physically updated on the bastion/gateway server(s).
  
    Go to Your IT VAEC Request
    Click on "Submit a Request"
    Complete Mandatory fields in Requester Information section
    Service Request Short Description: Access Request to VALERI RDP Gateway Servers - <email address>
    Service Request Description: enter the following (depending on the tier(s) you previously requested in Jira and ePAS)
      Per <enter in LOSD> Please add my PIV account to <vaecwins_aws_valeri-rds-gateway-nprod, vaecwins_aws_valeri-rds-gateway-prod>
      As a <enter your role>, I need access to these VALERI gateway server(s) to fulfil my daily functions.
      PIV = <enter your PIV>NMEA = <enter your NMEA>
